WEBVTT

00:06.297 --> 00:09.092
ALL NAMES, PLACES, AND PRODUCTS
ARE FICTIONAL AND DRAMATIZED

00:09.175 --> 00:10.385
AND DO NOT REFLECT REALITY

00:28.570 --> 00:29.779
Hello.

00:44.127 --> 00:49.299
Distinguished guests,
welcome to Boudoir's 2024 SS collection.

00:50.717 --> 00:52.052
Over here, please!

00:52.135 --> 00:54.971
Look over here, please!

00:58.099 --> 00:59.434
Shin So-ui seems to know her.

01:12.530 --> 01:14.574
Wow. It's snowing!

01:16.076 --> 01:17.368
Hey, look at that!

01:32.926 --> 01:34.177
Truth,

01:34.886 --> 01:36.221
like light,

01:36.721 --> 01:38.389
blinds us.

01:45.063 --> 01:46.898
Falsehood, on the other hand,

01:47.816 --> 01:49.776
is like a beautiful sunset

01:50.985 --> 01:53.154
that enhances everything.

02:00.703 --> 02:03.081
That is, until you get caught.

02:09.420 --> 02:10.463
Come on, hurry.

02:10.964 --> 02:13.174
- Is it here?
- I think it's there.

02:13.675 --> 02:14.592
Is that the line?

02:14.676 --> 02:16.219
What time is it?

02:17.262 --> 02:19.013
Hey, do you have one more hand warmer?

02:19.097 --> 02:20.348
We need more hand warmers.

02:20.431 --> 02:23.935
Of course I was camping outside
Apgujeong Hyundai and Apgujeong Galleria.

02:26.146 --> 02:28.982
They're holding out on me
because they recognize me.

02:30.650 --> 02:33.027
They're making such a fuss,
and they're not even BKC.

02:36.781 --> 02:37.699
Hey.

02:38.449 --> 02:39.909
I'll be at the Lotte Main Store.

02:39.993 --> 02:42.162
The silver Classic Medium drop
hit the chats.

02:42.871 --> 02:43.705
Okay.

03:30.793 --> 03:33.671
I was sitting there, and…
Oh, I can't bear to look.

03:33.755 --> 03:34.589
Good morning.

03:34.672 --> 03:37.217
The person was dead,
her face half mangled…

03:37.300 --> 03:38.134
Good morning.

03:39.802 --> 03:44.015
We've been searching for hours,
but are yet to find an ID or a cell phone.

03:45.767 --> 03:46.893
What about prints?

03:46.976 --> 03:48.186
No matches.

03:51.397 --> 03:52.523
We found a bag here.

03:52.607 --> 03:54.692
It seems she's been left here for days.

03:56.819 --> 04:00.240
I guess there's no one in her life
to report her missing.

04:11.167 --> 04:13.586
THE ART OF SARAH

04:15.588 --> 04:19.175
JANE DOE

04:19.259 --> 04:20.343
METROPOLITAN POLICE AGENCY

04:20.426 --> 04:23.346
We lifted partial prints
from the clasp of the bag.

04:23.429 --> 04:26.891
They're not enough to identify her,
but enough for a comparison.

04:26.975 --> 04:29.102
- Compared to the victim's?
- It's a match.

04:30.853 --> 04:32.021
And some aren't.

04:34.232 --> 04:37.026
Could they be the perpetrator's?

04:37.527 --> 04:38.987
We can't rule it out.

04:42.407 --> 04:44.617
But, you know… How shall I put this?

04:44.701 --> 04:46.244
It feels like a show-off.

04:46.327 --> 04:48.538
- Did you find something else?
- No.

04:48.621 --> 04:49.789
I mean, this bag.

04:50.290 --> 04:53.167
The color and leather choice is so unique.

04:54.043 --> 04:56.963
I bet there are only a few
with this combo in the world.

05:02.510 --> 05:03.845
Bags like these

05:03.928 --> 05:05.346
have serial numbers.

05:05.430 --> 05:06.264
Here.

05:09.100 --> 05:10.184
- Sir?
- Yes.

05:10.268 --> 05:11.477
- Police.
- Sorry?

05:11.978 --> 05:15.315
Sir, we kindly ask that you wait outside.

05:19.485 --> 05:20.653
Would it be possible…

05:23.156 --> 05:25.742
to find out who purchased
this particular product?

05:36.169 --> 05:40.089
The severity of the facial depression
suggests a vicious crime of passion.

05:40.173 --> 05:43.593
The victim's face was repeatedly struck
until the nose and gums caved in.

05:43.676 --> 05:45.678
Bam…

05:47.263 --> 05:49.599
But that was not the cause of death.

05:49.682 --> 05:50.975
Exposure was.

05:51.601 --> 05:53.144
She slowly froze to death.

05:54.812 --> 05:57.106
She froze to death
right in Cheongdam-dong?

05:58.399 --> 06:00.068
We had a record-breaking cold snap.

06:06.032 --> 06:08.117
SPLENDID MELANCHOLY

06:10.036 --> 06:11.871
"Splendid melancholy."

06:13.414 --> 06:14.415
JANE DOE?

06:14.499 --> 06:17.293
The fact that there are barely any traces

06:18.086 --> 06:20.088
means this was no ordinary person.

06:20.588 --> 06:21.672
The perpetrator?

06:25.051 --> 06:26.511
Do you know how much this costs?

06:26.594 --> 06:29.305
If the perpetrator left this bag behind
like it was nothing,

06:29.806 --> 06:31.849
that means they're either insane

06:32.350 --> 06:33.518
or insanely rich.

06:33.601 --> 06:34.602
Who are you?

06:34.685 --> 06:35.978
Hello, sir.

06:36.062 --> 06:39.190
I'm Hyeon Jae-hyeon, assigned
to Violent Crimes Team One as of today.

06:47.073 --> 06:48.116
Whose bag is it?

06:48.616 --> 06:50.827
The owner of the purple bag
is Jeong Yeo-jin,

06:50.910 --> 06:52.829
CEO of the cosmetic brand Nox.

06:53.704 --> 06:56.124
Apparently, she gave the bag to a friend.

06:56.999 --> 06:58.626
Now, that's an uncanny coincidence.

06:59.127 --> 07:01.421
Well, we should investigate further,

07:02.380 --> 07:04.549
but it looks like
we have the victim's identity.

07:05.091 --> 07:06.175
All right. Good work.

07:08.886 --> 07:11.722
Are you meeting someone about the case?
Should I come along?

07:12.682 --> 07:13.683
Your desk.

07:15.393 --> 07:16.394
Your job.

07:19.397 --> 07:21.607
Yes, this is Violent Crimes Team One.

07:34.704 --> 07:36.539
Would you take a look here too?

07:47.550 --> 07:48.759
Oh my God.

07:50.928 --> 07:51.971
It's her. It's Sarah.

07:55.433 --> 07:58.311
We can stop if this is too hard for you.

07:58.394 --> 07:59.687
I'd…

08:00.396 --> 08:03.107
I'd like to have a moment alone.

08:06.110 --> 08:08.779
Very well. I'll give you five minutes.

08:11.532 --> 08:16.329
MORGUE
NATIONAL FORENSIC SERVICE

08:30.259 --> 08:33.304
She gave the bag to Sarah Kim,
the regional head of this company.

08:41.270 --> 08:42.271
Here you go.

08:44.273 --> 08:45.525
Thank you.

08:48.903 --> 08:51.072
You two must have been very close.

08:52.448 --> 08:55.910
Well, I gave her that bag.
That says it all, doesn't it?

08:57.870 --> 08:59.413
I'd like to hear more details.

09:02.375 --> 09:06.420
It all began with the Birkin bag.

09:26.399 --> 09:27.942
Excuse me, ma'am?

09:32.196 --> 09:33.364
Ma'am?

10:09.191 --> 10:11.694
Are you looking for
anything in particular?

10:13.571 --> 10:16.073
I thought it'd be Epsom,
but it's Clemence leather.

10:16.907 --> 10:18.534
I can try it on, right?

10:18.618 --> 10:20.703
Please be careful with the bag.

10:24.790 --> 10:26.375
I'm sorry,

10:26.459 --> 10:29.337
but photography isn't allowed
inside the store.

10:30.921 --> 10:33.257
Would you kindly delete the photos?

11:03.537 --> 11:04.830
May I store that for you?

11:04.914 --> 11:06.791
No. It's fine.

11:09.460 --> 11:10.503
Ma'am.

11:11.087 --> 11:12.380
Please observe only--

11:12.463 --> 11:14.882
I'll take everything I've touched so far.

11:15.383 --> 11:16.217
Sorry?

11:18.844 --> 11:21.597
I said I'll buy everything
I've touched so far.

11:22.098 --> 11:23.516
You remember them all, right?

11:34.443 --> 11:36.737
Let me help you sign up
for membership first.

11:37.238 --> 11:38.823
May I have your name, please?

11:41.158 --> 11:42.493
Sarah Kim.

11:42.576 --> 11:44.662
You must have spent time abroad.

11:45.162 --> 11:46.163
And your address?

11:47.998 --> 11:50.626
Just fill in the rest
with your information.

11:50.710 --> 11:51.711
Sorry?

11:54.171 --> 11:55.005
Of course.

11:57.466 --> 11:59.093
Your membership is all set.

11:59.927 --> 12:03.556
We can proceed to your payment.
May I have your credit card and ID?

12:09.854 --> 12:10.980
But I'm paying in cash.

12:22.366 --> 12:23.784
Here is one million won.

12:23.868 --> 12:25.828
That makes ten million in total.

12:28.706 --> 12:30.124
Here is five million.

12:39.341 --> 12:43.721
That was the moment Sarah became
someone I could never forget.

12:44.221 --> 12:47.308
She was odd, yet I was oddly drawn to her.

12:47.391 --> 12:49.351
I've been waiting for half a year.

12:49.435 --> 12:50.895
I figured you might be waiting,

12:50.978 --> 12:53.606
so I contacted you
the moment the tracking number came out.

13:29.058 --> 13:31.435
Could I try this bag on?

13:33.312 --> 13:34.605
I'm sorry.

13:34.688 --> 13:37.316
That bag is a special-order item.

13:41.695 --> 13:42.988
Is it, by any chance,

13:43.864 --> 13:45.241
for Sarah Kim?

13:46.033 --> 13:49.411
All I knew was her name,

13:49.495 --> 13:53.082
but I instinctively knew
she was someone extraordinary.

13:53.874 --> 13:56.585
- Because everyone noticed Sarah.
- Sarah Kim?

13:56.669 --> 13:58.504
Yes, Sarah Kim.

13:59.547 --> 14:03.384
She's Boudoir's Head of Asia Operations
and the sponsor of my latest movie.

14:03.467 --> 14:04.885
Boudoir?

14:04.969 --> 14:06.387
First time hearing it, right?

14:06.887 --> 14:10.391
It's a high-end brand that's served
European royalty for 100 years.

14:10.474 --> 14:12.893
Apparently, it only sells to the top 0.1%.

14:13.477 --> 14:14.645
Let me see.

14:14.728 --> 14:16.522
They're launching in Korea too.

14:17.022 --> 14:18.691
I might have heard of it.

14:18.774 --> 14:20.276
So she's their regional head.

14:22.069 --> 14:24.655
Goodness, why are portions here so small?

14:24.738 --> 14:27.700
Tell me about it.
We don't have great seats either.

14:29.618 --> 14:33.998
Someone's all dressed up today.
Who are you trying to impress?

14:34.498 --> 14:35.791
Don't tell me it's an ex.

14:37.334 --> 14:39.795
An ex? I would've been way past that.

14:39.879 --> 14:42.715
No, this one's
far more shameless and nasty.

14:47.136 --> 14:49.597
You must be in the middle
of a VIP gathering.

14:50.598 --> 14:53.058
- Hello, Chairwoman.
- Who were you again?

14:54.226 --> 14:56.562
I send you our products every year,

14:56.645 --> 14:59.106
but they don't seem
to be reaching you successfully.

14:59.189 --> 15:00.149
The CEO of Nox.

15:00.232 --> 15:01.317
Drugstore cosmetics.

15:01.400 --> 15:02.484
I see.

15:02.568 --> 15:05.279
You don't deal with local brands,
Chairwoman.

15:06.113 --> 15:07.406
So, what brings you by?

15:08.908 --> 15:10.367
Since we ran into each other,

15:10.451 --> 15:14.288
I wanted to ask about the reason
you rejected my membership application.

15:14.371 --> 15:15.831
The reason?

15:18.042 --> 15:19.752
The purpose of our gathering

15:19.835 --> 15:24.757
is to spend time with people
who see, feel, and enjoy the same things.

15:25.382 --> 15:29.094
In that sense, I concluded
that we don't necessarily align.

15:29.678 --> 15:30.679
We don't "align"?

15:31.722 --> 15:33.557
Is that all it was?

15:36.477 --> 15:40.439
Saying "Is that all it was?"
would make your life too miserable.

15:40.940 --> 15:44.151
"That" is the reason
you're sitting by the restroom

15:44.234 --> 15:45.653
and I'm sitting up here.

15:48.322 --> 15:50.115
I see you don't understand,

15:50.199 --> 15:53.410
so let me use how we approach food
as an example.

15:54.370 --> 15:57.873
Class often shows
in whether one prioritizes

15:58.707 --> 16:01.627
quantity, quality, or presentation.

16:03.003 --> 16:04.505
I prioritize presentation.

16:04.588 --> 16:06.131
How about you?

16:06.632 --> 16:08.425
Quantity or quality?

16:10.135 --> 16:12.221
We've only just met.

16:13.222 --> 16:15.057
Why do you assume you know me?

16:15.140 --> 16:16.809
I think I do know you.

16:18.769 --> 16:21.772
Fine. Let's take how one views
luxury goods as an example.

16:21.855 --> 16:25.067
Do you prioritize the price, the logo,

16:25.150 --> 16:26.944
or the rarity?

16:28.320 --> 16:30.072
Shall I take a guess?

16:34.118 --> 16:35.786
You value all three.

16:36.370 --> 16:38.706
Whatever it is,
you want to appear to have it all.

16:39.665 --> 16:42.251
I believe they call that desperation.

16:52.970 --> 16:55.556
- Did you see her bag?
- I'm so embarrassed for her.

16:55.639 --> 16:57.474
- Seriously.
- What on earth?

17:00.769 --> 17:02.021
- Oh no!
- My God. Excuse me.

17:02.104 --> 17:03.772
- My precious bag!
- Hold on.

17:04.857 --> 17:06.025
It's fine. I'll do it.

17:06.525 --> 17:07.943
I'm so sorry.

17:09.611 --> 17:10.654
Stop that.

17:10.738 --> 17:11.697
I'm sorry.

17:14.199 --> 17:15.117
I said stop!

17:20.372 --> 17:21.373
My bag!

17:26.003 --> 17:27.087
I'm very sorry.

17:27.171 --> 17:28.630
This is all my fault.

17:30.007 --> 17:31.967
How can I make this up to you?

17:34.428 --> 17:36.930
We're both at fault. So just go.

17:38.265 --> 17:39.892
Then how about we do this?

17:43.604 --> 17:44.730
What are you doing?

17:46.523 --> 17:49.401
I won't make empty promises
about getting you the same bag,

17:49.902 --> 17:51.528
and you're refusing compensation.

17:54.573 --> 17:57.076
And I think this color goes better
with your outfit.

17:57.826 --> 17:59.119
So how about a fair trade?

18:00.621 --> 18:02.372
If you know the value of that bag,

18:02.456 --> 18:05.042
I'm sure you know
the value of this one too.

18:14.718 --> 18:16.762
You're the CEO of Nox, right?

18:18.889 --> 18:21.433
I'm a fan of this lipstick too.

18:58.262 --> 19:00.973
Ms. Jeong. Care to go for round two?

19:01.056 --> 19:04.101
Who could possibly turn down
an offer like that?

19:04.184 --> 19:05.269
- One, two…
- One, two…

19:05.352 --> 19:07.813
Sarah was always making me
offers I couldn't refuse.

19:08.480 --> 19:09.982
She was always doing that.

19:12.442 --> 19:14.403
Whipped cream cake with soju?

19:16.446 --> 19:19.158
Mismatches sometimes make
the perfect combination.

19:25.706 --> 19:27.749
I'm sorry about earlier.

19:28.500 --> 19:32.796
I took my anger out on the wrong person.
Is the spot where I hit you okay?

19:33.297 --> 19:36.008
Actually, I used to do shot put.

19:37.759 --> 19:38.844
Ms. Jeong.

19:40.053 --> 19:42.347
You were practically
an attempted murderer.

19:47.144 --> 19:49.688
Oh, that pile of cash.

19:49.771 --> 19:51.815
- That was you, right?
- Did you see me?

19:55.652 --> 19:57.487
Oh God, that's so embarrassing.

19:59.364 --> 20:03.243
I had just arrived in Korea,
so I hadn't even washed up properly.

20:04.077 --> 20:06.121
I thought you were a total nightmare.

20:07.039 --> 20:08.207
Please forget that.

20:08.290 --> 20:10.918
Something that impactful?
No, that's not possible.

20:11.543 --> 20:15.255
Come on. Nothing's impossible.
I even befriended an attempted murderer.

20:15.339 --> 20:16.673
I can think of plenty.

20:18.300 --> 20:22.346
Since you work in the luxury industry,
you must've seen plenty like me.

20:23.180 --> 20:25.933
People splashing their cash
to lose the "new money" tag.

20:27.017 --> 20:28.936
They say flaunting
is a sign of insecurity.

20:31.688 --> 20:32.940
Does it show a lot?

20:34.149 --> 20:35.150
What about me?

20:35.234 --> 20:36.276
Can you tell?

20:37.861 --> 20:40.364
Hey. You and I are different.

20:40.447 --> 20:42.658
You're a Korean American
who went to Oxford.

20:42.741 --> 20:45.244
You're as elite as they come,
so don't try to relate.

20:46.203 --> 20:50.207
They say true wealth shows
in your air miles, not your bank balance.

20:50.832 --> 20:51.917
They're not wrong.

20:53.293 --> 20:55.170
There's more than meets the eye.

21:07.099 --> 21:08.934
I wish it would snow.

21:09.434 --> 21:10.644
Like heavy flurries.

21:11.520 --> 21:14.523
But it's the middle of summer.
That would be impossible.

21:14.606 --> 21:16.066
Who knows?

21:16.733 --> 21:18.610
It just hasn't happened yet.

21:20.570 --> 21:24.157
Sarah was perfectly perfect that day.

21:24.241 --> 21:25.659
That day, I realized

21:26.159 --> 21:29.204
I had endured over 40 years of loneliness

21:29.288 --> 21:31.915
just to meet Sarah.

21:39.423 --> 21:41.967
It's not who you are that matters

21:42.676 --> 21:44.720
but who you appear to be.

21:45.345 --> 21:48.015
- That's how we became friends.
- Presence and nuance.

21:48.098 --> 21:50.851
Those beneath me envied me for what I had,

21:50.934 --> 21:53.937
and those above me looked down on me
for what I lacked.

21:54.438 --> 21:55.647
Sarah was the only one…

21:55.731 --> 21:56.690
This is nice.

21:56.773 --> 21:59.026
…who brought me the things I desired.

21:59.109 --> 22:01.361
That's a Yoo Yeong piece. Gonna buy it?

22:01.445 --> 22:02.738
SENSES BEYOND THE CANVAS
YOO YEONG

22:02.821 --> 22:04.072
The rights, not the piece.

22:04.156 --> 22:06.116
It'd be great
as the launch gift box design.

22:06.199 --> 22:08.118
You don't think others have made offers?

22:08.702 --> 22:12.414
Dozens have tried and failed.

22:12.497 --> 22:13.832
That makes me like it more.

22:13.915 --> 22:17.085
They say you only ever get two answers
from Yoo Yeong.

22:17.169 --> 22:20.380
Either "call rejected" or "email unread."

22:20.464 --> 22:23.050
She's simply impossible to reach.

22:23.133 --> 22:25.886
I guess you pay attention
to what people who have failed say,

22:26.386 --> 22:27.721
but not to what I say.

22:29.264 --> 22:30.390
I told you.

22:30.891 --> 22:32.726
It just hasn't happened yet.

22:37.356 --> 22:39.649
If you want to know the value of someone,

22:40.150 --> 22:43.236
focus on what they don't have,
not what they have.

22:43.862 --> 22:45.530
The Sarah I know

22:45.614 --> 22:48.158
didn't leave lipstick smudges on cups,

22:48.241 --> 22:50.494
didn't have space
in the backseat of her car,

22:51.036 --> 22:53.663
and acted without hesitation.

23:09.346 --> 23:12.766
ARTIST YOO YEONG

23:14.518 --> 23:15.519
Not gonna answer?

23:15.602 --> 23:17.396
I want her to get more desperate.

23:17.479 --> 23:18.730
Wow.

23:18.814 --> 23:20.607
How did you coax her?

23:20.690 --> 23:23.693
There are three things
artists absolutely can't bear.

23:23.777 --> 23:26.279
One, "I am ordinary."

23:26.780 --> 23:29.032
Two, "I am ordinary."

23:29.116 --> 23:30.075
And three,

23:30.659 --> 23:31.868
"I am ordinary."

23:32.619 --> 23:34.496
So you flattered her as being unique.

23:34.579 --> 23:36.164
I called her ordinary.

23:36.248 --> 23:38.708
Now she's dying to prove me wrong.

23:43.672 --> 23:46.216
What's with all the luggage back there?

23:46.299 --> 23:48.009
I want to move hotels.

23:48.093 --> 23:50.512
I think the housekeeper
is going through my stuff.

23:51.388 --> 23:54.724
Why don't you come to my house instead?
The second floor is empty.

23:55.308 --> 23:56.143
Really?

23:56.810 --> 23:57.686
Sounds good.

23:57.769 --> 23:59.229
Yay!

24:13.410 --> 24:15.370
Are you sure you're 38?

24:15.454 --> 24:17.122
You look like a twenty-something.

24:19.749 --> 24:22.461
You can buy anything with money.
Even youth.

25:03.460 --> 25:05.545
I wish it would snow.

25:06.046 --> 25:09.174
But it's the middle of summer.
That would be impossible.

25:09.674 --> 25:10.967
I told you.

25:11.468 --> 25:13.386
It just hasn't happened yet.

25:14.721 --> 25:18.808
It was the most beautiful fake
I had ever laid eyes on.

25:25.982 --> 25:28.068
Is that the bag you traded with Sarah Kim?

25:29.986 --> 25:32.948
Why do you think the suspect
left the Birkin bag at the scene?

25:33.448 --> 25:37.702
If not for that, identifying the victim
might have been impossible.

25:39.079 --> 25:41.706
Maybe it's a ploy to frame me
as the murderer.

25:42.916 --> 25:45.085
There is a reason
behind every clue at a scene.

25:45.585 --> 25:48.880
I am looking for those reasons,
not the clues.

25:50.507 --> 25:51.967
Does anything come to mind?

25:54.344 --> 25:55.345
I'm not sure.

25:55.845 --> 25:58.640
Even as friends,
I am sure things were not always good.

25:59.140 --> 26:00.267
At this age,

26:00.976 --> 26:04.813
being able to make a new friend
is an incredibly rare thing.

26:06.523 --> 26:08.984
It's far more challenging
than owning a Birkin,

26:10.151 --> 26:12.028
and far harder

26:12.821 --> 26:14.155
than pulling one off.

26:15.657 --> 26:16.533
Oh my!

26:16.616 --> 26:18.451
It made me think of you.

26:32.382 --> 26:34.467
Hey, how do I look?

26:35.135 --> 26:36.386
Does it suit me?

26:40.599 --> 26:42.142
- Here, let me.
- Yeah?

26:46.354 --> 26:48.356
Like this. Here.

26:53.903 --> 26:55.655
- Try walking around with it.
- Okay.

27:02.996 --> 27:06.207
I don't suppose Boudoir
is planning on doing ready-to-wear?

27:06.291 --> 27:08.501
It'd be nice to have matching outfit sets.

27:09.544 --> 27:11.421
We have our sights on something bigger.

27:12.380 --> 27:15.717
I plan to build Hotel Boudoir,
filled with Boudoir items.

27:15.800 --> 27:19.512
From the furniture and wallpaper
to the lighting, towels, dishes,

27:19.596 --> 27:20.805
and even the fragrance.

27:20.889 --> 27:23.892
That means you would need amenities too.

27:25.060 --> 27:26.353
I'd imagine so.

27:28.730 --> 27:30.649
What if our brands joined forces?

27:34.069 --> 27:35.278
Anything is possible.

27:38.573 --> 27:39.699
I don't know.

27:40.200 --> 27:42.952
Don't you think Boudoir and Nox
have different objectives?

28:03.348 --> 28:04.641
After she said that,

28:05.266 --> 28:07.519
she went around
having meals with Choi Chae-u.

28:11.064 --> 28:14.150
How about making
a strategic investment in Boudoir?

28:15.610 --> 28:18.863
We can discuss it
after reviewing the company.

28:18.947 --> 28:21.658
What if we lose our chance
by sticking to procedure?

28:21.741 --> 28:22.951
More importantly,

28:23.034 --> 28:26.037
I don't think
the two brands necessarily align.

28:26.121 --> 28:28.373
We've been in talks
about investment with a place.

28:28.456 --> 28:30.208
Do we need to take a risk?

28:30.291 --> 28:31.459
"Align"?

28:33.712 --> 28:37.173
By that, are you taking a shot at Boudoir

28:37.257 --> 28:38.925
or at Nox?

28:39.008 --> 28:43.138
I'm saying let's leverage Boudoir's name,
since I'm sick of hearing crap like this.

28:43.221 --> 28:44.931
Come on, people.

28:45.890 --> 28:47.684
Let's level up already.

29:00.029 --> 29:01.281
Yeo-jin.

29:01.364 --> 29:02.198
Yes?

29:04.159 --> 29:06.119
I think we're dreaming the same dream.

29:12.041 --> 29:14.461
- How much should I invest?
- How much can you do?

29:14.961 --> 29:15.962
Ten billion won.

29:19.466 --> 29:20.675
Add five billion to that.

29:23.094 --> 29:24.095
Okay.

29:42.614 --> 29:45.325
The gray hair shampoo
will soon be approved by the FDS,

29:45.825 --> 29:47.243
so invest as much as you can.

29:47.327 --> 29:49.788
Weren't you in talks
to invest in this company?

29:49.871 --> 29:52.248
- Something about expanding your bath line?
- Well…

29:52.332 --> 29:55.251
I think the shampoo and Nox
have different objectives.

29:55.335 --> 29:56.461
What's going on?

29:56.961 --> 29:59.923
You heard a good investment tip somewhere,
didn't you?

30:00.006 --> 30:03.176
Come on, do share.
Don't keep it all to yourself.

30:03.259 --> 30:04.344
Seriously.

30:04.427 --> 30:05.345
I know.

30:05.428 --> 30:07.347
Boudoir. I invested in Boudoir.

30:07.430 --> 30:09.557
- Oh, Sarah Kim's brand?
- Yes.

30:09.641 --> 30:11.184
Isn't that a bit hasty?

30:11.267 --> 30:13.728
Frankly, I hadn't heard
of the brand until recently.

30:13.812 --> 30:15.104
That's understandable.

30:15.188 --> 30:18.525
After all,
Boudoir only sells to the top 0.1%.

30:18.608 --> 30:19.567
Honestly.

30:19.651 --> 30:20.485
Unbelievable.

30:20.568 --> 30:22.946
It wasn't long
until they came to regret it dearly.

30:23.029 --> 30:24.239
FLAGSHIP STORE OPENS IN ASIA

30:24.322 --> 30:25.698
EUROPEAN LUXURY BRAND BOUDOIR

30:25.782 --> 30:27.700
Boudoir was a hit.

30:28.618 --> 30:30.578
It was a huge success.

30:31.871 --> 30:35.124
It was at the center of attention
as soon as it arrived.

30:35.208 --> 30:38.127
The people who make the world go around
flocked to it like moths to a flame.

30:38.211 --> 30:39.629
BOUDOIR IS A PIECE OF ART, NOT A BAG

30:39.712 --> 30:41.840
IT'S A EUROPEAN ROYALTY BRAND
A CLASS OF ITS OWN

30:50.265 --> 30:51.391
BOUDOIR IS SOLD OUT AGAIN?

30:51.474 --> 30:52.559
BOUDOIR STORE ROCKS!

30:54.727 --> 30:56.062
DEPOSIT ALERT

30:56.145 --> 30:57.814
Wait. 1.5 billion?

30:57.897 --> 31:01.901
I received 1.5 billion won in dividends
for the first month.

31:02.652 --> 31:06.406
At that rate, it was like raking in money
while sitting down.

31:06.489 --> 31:08.616
Thank you. Thank you so much.

31:10.410 --> 31:13.329
That day marked the end of one style

31:13.413 --> 31:16.082
and the rise of a new trend.

31:16.791 --> 31:19.961
Because Boudoir had launched
its new collection.

31:24.632 --> 31:29.220
And that was the last day I saw Sarah.

31:31.222 --> 31:35.560
Sarah seemed like she could leave
at the drop of a hat.

31:37.020 --> 31:38.897
She never unpacked her suitcase

31:39.689 --> 31:42.066
in the entire time
she was staying at my house.

31:44.903 --> 31:46.446
That hurt me back then.

31:48.448 --> 31:49.616
If I had

31:50.742 --> 31:54.871
reported Sarah missing right away,

31:55.747 --> 31:57.749
would things have turned out differently?

32:09.302 --> 32:11.304
Would you send me a photo of her?

32:11.804 --> 32:14.057
I should know what the victim looks like.

32:14.557 --> 32:16.684
Sadly, I don't have any.

32:16.768 --> 32:19.145
She never liked having her picture taken.

32:20.146 --> 32:21.439
I see.

32:21.940 --> 32:23.650
Thank you for your time.

32:24.275 --> 32:25.735
- Isn't that odd?
- What?

32:27.779 --> 32:29.238
She put the Birkin on the floor.

32:29.322 --> 32:31.616
The bag even has history
with her late friend.

32:31.699 --> 32:34.410
Either the bag's fake
or the friendship is. Or both.

32:34.911 --> 32:37.455
- Maybe that's a stretch.
- One more thing.

32:37.538 --> 32:39.123
One moment.

32:42.251 --> 32:45.004
She never loses her composure
throughout the interview.

32:45.505 --> 32:46.881
Everything's too perfect.

32:46.965 --> 32:49.258
Both Jeong Yeo-jin
and the Sarah Kim she speaks of.

32:49.342 --> 32:51.928
- Am I the only one who finds this odd?
- I agree.

32:52.011 --> 32:53.888
It is odd. I mean, you are, sir.

32:54.806 --> 32:59.060
You're saying there's something wrong
because nothing's wrong.

32:59.143 --> 33:03.523
The fact is, she looks like a woman
dazed by the loss of a friend.

33:03.606 --> 33:05.233
That's a bias, not a fact.

33:05.316 --> 33:08.027
Well, just because you're not hungry,

33:08.111 --> 33:11.197
you think we won't be either.

33:11.280 --> 33:13.074
That is a bias.

33:13.574 --> 33:15.660
Seriously, aren't you going to eat?

33:16.160 --> 33:17.704
Then do you mind if we do?

33:19.747 --> 33:20.790
Let's go.

33:21.416 --> 33:22.917
- We'll be back.
- See you later.

33:23.835 --> 33:24.669
Come on.

34:15.178 --> 34:16.554
NAME: JEONG YEO-JIN

34:16.637 --> 34:18.431
INVESTIGATION SUBJECT SEARCH
JEONG YEO-JIN

34:21.392 --> 34:22.351
ROBBERY-LINKED ASSAULT

34:22.435 --> 34:23.728
SUMMONS TO APPEAR

34:28.733 --> 34:30.485
FINANCIAL CRIMES INVESTIGATION UNIT

34:30.568 --> 34:31.944
Sir, hold on!

34:32.028 --> 34:36.783
Verify that the murder victim, Sarah Kim,
is a US citizen with Foreign Affairs.

34:36.866 --> 34:37.700
Sir?

34:38.951 --> 34:40.328
FINANCIAL CRIMES INVESTIGATION UNIT

34:45.666 --> 34:47.710
To what do I owe the dishonor?

34:47.794 --> 34:49.003
I need some information.

34:49.504 --> 34:51.839
My case and yours
have something in common.

34:52.924 --> 34:54.175
Jeong Yeo-jin.

34:55.384 --> 34:56.803
Oh, that case.

34:57.303 --> 35:01.224
We arrested a suspect
for kidnapping, assault, and extortion.

35:01.307 --> 35:03.392
But it turned out someone had hired them.

35:03.476 --> 35:04.936
And that was Jeong Yeo-jin.

35:05.770 --> 35:10.399
The suspect said Jeong demanded
that Kim repay the funds she invested,

35:10.483 --> 35:11.818
but Kim didn't comply.

35:13.694 --> 35:16.155
A whopping 15 billion won in total.

35:17.031 --> 35:19.534
Not even best friends
can withstand the test of money.

35:20.034 --> 35:22.829
And this part is still confidential,

35:22.912 --> 35:26.999
but it seems that Jeong
siphoned off company funds to invest.

35:27.083 --> 35:29.127
It's been months!

35:29.794 --> 35:32.088
I haven't received a dime
since the first month.

35:32.171 --> 35:35.633
See, this is why I said
I didn't want to work with you.

35:35.716 --> 35:38.678
You're so desperate and impatient
about every little thing.

35:40.555 --> 35:43.558
You're wound so tight
that you still seem like a tacky commoner,

35:43.641 --> 35:44.684
despite being a CEO.

35:44.767 --> 35:46.769
I wouldn't do this if it were my money!

35:47.770 --> 35:51.107
The investment funds came
from misappropriated company money.

35:53.317 --> 35:54.152
What?

35:54.235 --> 35:55.653
I'm in real trouble.

35:56.279 --> 35:57.405
If there's an audit--

35:57.488 --> 35:58.948
Why the hell did you do that?

35:59.448 --> 36:01.826
I told you to do only what you're told!

36:02.410 --> 36:04.203
Why are you angry?

36:04.829 --> 36:06.497
You're the one not paying up!

36:06.581 --> 36:07.832
Yeo-jin.

36:08.749 --> 36:10.835
If you get caught, you're done for.

36:12.253 --> 36:14.505
I'm concerned for you, see?

36:15.006 --> 36:15.882
Yeo-jin.

36:16.841 --> 36:20.511
Don't say a word about this to anyone.

36:21.179 --> 36:22.555
Wow.

36:23.347 --> 36:24.974
How did you get this?

36:26.017 --> 36:26.851
Why?

36:28.603 --> 36:29.645
Just a moment.

37:01.594 --> 37:02.470
Now,

37:03.095 --> 37:05.306
can you tell which one's the fake?

37:06.557 --> 37:07.808
No, I can't.

37:07.892 --> 37:09.602
Which is why you were fooled.

37:11.270 --> 37:12.855
Here, take a look.

37:14.023 --> 37:15.024
Closer.

37:18.402 --> 37:20.488
It's a little too perfect, isn't it?

37:20.988 --> 37:24.033
A highly evolved counterfeit
surpasses the authentic.

37:24.533 --> 37:27.286
Because the real thing
doesn't aim for perfection.

37:27.370 --> 37:28.621
You're saying it's perfect,

37:29.121 --> 37:30.164
so it's a fake?

37:30.248 --> 37:31.832
Yes. 100%.

37:32.541 --> 37:36.087
Wow. I've never seen
anything like this before.

37:38.547 --> 37:40.758
So, would you like me
to take it off your hands?

37:41.842 --> 37:43.469
How much is it worth, then?

37:43.552 --> 37:44.387
Five million won?

37:46.055 --> 37:47.139
Five and a half?

38:24.885 --> 38:26.846
The victim was no ordinary person either.

38:26.929 --> 38:28.764
Or maybe she has some serious pull.

38:29.765 --> 38:32.768
I even got pressure from higher up
to make this case a priority.

38:32.852 --> 38:34.812
Well, she is the regional head of Boudoir.

38:34.895 --> 38:36.063
"The regional head"?

38:36.605 --> 38:39.150
No, the victim was a salesperson.

38:39.817 --> 38:41.027
A salesperson?

38:43.279 --> 38:45.740
Name, Woo Hyo-eun. Age, 30.

38:46.240 --> 38:48.409
They must've mixed something up.

38:48.492 --> 38:51.662
They kidnapped the salesperson
instead of Sarah Kim.

38:51.746 --> 38:53.414
- Here.
- Her name is Woo Hyo-eun?

38:53.497 --> 38:54.874
DRIVER'S LICENSE
WOO HYO-EUN

38:54.957 --> 38:56.542
Let's run a fingerprint search.

38:57.585 --> 38:59.795
- Hey, where's our fingerprinting kit?
- Yes?

39:02.173 --> 39:04.592
Oh, I understand.

39:04.675 --> 39:05.801
Have a good day.

39:09.472 --> 39:10.514
- Hey, Ji-hun.
- Yes?

39:10.598 --> 39:12.016
Start the report first.

39:12.516 --> 39:13.351
Yes, ma'am.

39:15.770 --> 39:17.646
She has a cast on her left leg

39:18.647 --> 39:20.024
and bruises on her face.

39:29.492 --> 39:30.951
Just make it through a week.

39:48.052 --> 39:48.969
Excuse me.

39:52.431 --> 39:54.225
I don't have a handkerchief.

39:58.229 --> 39:59.647
Do you know me?

40:00.773 --> 40:03.901
I'm sure every person passing through
a police station has a story.

40:04.485 --> 40:05.903
Just call it philanthropy.

40:16.122 --> 40:18.874
A navy tie will go better with that suit
than this.

40:31.053 --> 40:32.096
You got it wrong.

40:34.723 --> 40:36.976
The crutch should be on the other side.

40:50.197 --> 40:51.282
Hey, Park Mu-gyeong!

40:53.284 --> 40:57.246
The suspect, Min Byeong-kwan,
said he'd give your team intel on Boudoir.

40:57.329 --> 40:58.581
Did you look into it?

40:59.165 --> 41:01.750
The Boudoir bags
they snatched as collateral…

41:01.834 --> 41:03.752
Well, if what he claims is true,

41:04.378 --> 41:06.464
they were all counterfeit.

41:08.924 --> 41:11.135
Who received the intel about Boudoir?

41:13.137 --> 41:14.305
I did.

41:21.145 --> 41:24.315
Foreign Affairs just replied
saying they can't verify the identity.

41:25.357 --> 41:26.192
What?

41:26.275 --> 41:28.110
There is no Sarah Kim.

41:28.694 --> 41:32.239
No one matches that name,
age, birthplace, or education.

41:42.208 --> 41:44.043
JANE DOE

43:09.003 --> 43:14.008
Subtitle translation by: Yung Un Choi
